WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.480
this is how to win in chess in two moves&nbsp;
first of all you have to be playing as black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.720
and this only works if your opponent&nbsp;
moves their pawns in a certain way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:17.600
let's say they move their pawn to the f3&nbsp;
square then you move your pawn to the e5 square&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:24.080
then if they move their pawn to g4 move&nbsp;
your queen to this square h4 and that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.840
checkmate the white king has no spaces to move to&nbsp;
and no other pieces to block the queen's attack

